' Train jdBasic - lesson 09: 09 | Graphics | Pixels on Screen
' Chapter: Layered shapes
' Board edition: draws on the board's own screen, 320 by 240, and hands
' the screen back to the console after three seconds.

SCREEN 320, 240
GFX.CONSOLE 0
DRAWCOLOR 30, 30, 50
RECT 0, 0, 320, 240, TRUE
DRAWCOLOR 80, 200, 255
RECT 50, 50, 220, 140, TRUE
DRAWCOLOR 255, 100, 100
CIRCLE 160, 120, 40, TRUE
DRAWCOLOR 255, 255, 255
LINE 0, 0, 319, 239
LINE 319, 0, 0, 239
SCREENFLIP
SLEEP 3000
GFX.CONSOLE 1
